{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QDJgJJXpmheewahxp91euU","type":"tool_result","content":"112:- `E.build: \"dev-build\"`: the commit this copy was built from, a placeholder in the repo that tools/stamp.mjs replaces when the site deploys (e.g. 'a1b2c3d 2026-10-07')\n666:- `new E.Humanoid(o = {}) → rig`: new E.Humanoid({ size: 1.3, build, weapon, outfit, hair, hat, sleeves, armor, hood, cape, colors, ... }): a character rig posed from math every step (API.md, \"Characters\", lists the options); update(dt, state) each step, draw(g, ox, oy, view) inside r.actor. hat: 'cap' | 'band' | 'crown' | 'helmet' | 'pointed' (or { style, color }); hood: true (drawn in colors.hair)\n748:- `map.drop(from, dir, o = {})`: what lies past the edge ahead: the first drop of more than step within reach (default 12) of `from` in direction dir, and the ground a body of its radius lands on just past it: { x, y, z, fall } or null (no edge, or a wall first). AI that won't walk off roofs, hop-downs, fall warnings\n1689:- `strategy.ai(side, plan)` †: run side by plan ({ build: [[kind, n]], waves: { first, every, min }, script }): see the manual\n....\n1054:- `game.audio.define(name, voice)`: add or replace a named sound: audio.define('zap', { wave: 'saw', freq: 1200, to: 200, dur: .2 })\n1063:- `game.audio.sfx(what, o = {})`: Play a sound effect: a preset name ('jump', 'coin', 'hit', 'explode', ...), a voice object, or a list of voices. opts: { vol: 0..1, pitch: multiplier, vary: random pitch spread (default 0.03), step: a step of the music playing (it sounds on that step of the music clock, scheduled with the music: a rhythm game's calls and claps) }\n1074:- `game.audio.offset = 0` †: seconds the music sounds early, for speakers and headphones that lag (settings.audioOffset)\n1075:- `game.audio.presets`: the named sound effects, sfx(name) plays one and define(name, voice) adds one\n1106:- `new E.Dialog(game, o = {}) → talk`: new E.Dialog(game, { speed, lines, place, color, nameColor, voice, bg, border, vars }): a dialog box that types its text; say() opens it, update(dt) and draw(r) run it\n1123:- `talk.name`: the speaker's name shown on the box\n1124:- `talk.nameColor = '#ffd36a'`: the speaker's name's color\n1134:- `talk.voice = 'text'`: the sound effect each letter blips ('text'; null for silence)\n1267:- `click.say(lines, who)` †: the hero says lines (over his head; a line's time by its length); who: anything with x, y and k to speak instead\n1543:- `new E.Rhythm(game, o = {}) → rhythm` †: new E.Rhythm(game, { song, chart, lanes, windows, life, lead, voice, on }): see the manual\n1570:- `rhythm.voice` †: the calls' sound\n1668:- `story.people`: who speaks, by id ({ name, portrait, at })\n1672:- `story.talk`: the E.Dialog it speaks through\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174822__x21985c/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5ddd0aea-0d8f-48ab-8f8a-03ad6fdbf27a","uuid":"23376842-6241-48b4-adec-9b8022072519","timestamp":"2026-11-04T00:55:03.702Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"112:- `E.build: \"dev-build\"`: the commit this copy was built from, a placeholder in the repo that tools/stamp.mjs replaces when the site deploys (e.g. 'a1b2c3d 2026-10-07')\n666:- `new E.Humanoid(o = {}) → rig`: new E.Humanoid({ size: 1.3, build, weapon, outfit, hair, hat, sleeves, armor, hood, cape, colors, ... }): a character rig posed from math every step (API.md, \"Characters\", lists the options); update(dt, state) each step, draw(g, ox, oy, view) inside r.actor. hat: 'cap' | 'band' | 'crown' | 'helmet' | 'pointed' (or { style, color }); hood: true (drawn in colors.hair)\n748:- `map.drop(from, dir, o = {})`: what lies past the edge ahead: the first drop of more than step within reach (default 12) of `from` in direction dir, and the ground a body of its radius lands on just past it: { x, y, z, fall } or null (no edge, or a wall first). AI that won't walk