{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BmnBPYdik4f2KMVBcQggv8","type":"tool_result","content":"165:- `E.ik3(a, b, L1, L2, hint)`: two-bone IK in 3D: returns [joint, end]. hint points the way the joint should bend.\n283:- `input.codeLabel(code)`: a code as a person reads it: 'W' (or the keyboard's own letter there), 'Space', '↑', 'Left click', and a gamepad button by its symbol on the controller in use ('A', '✕', 'B'...; glyphs picks the family)\n292:- `input.label(a, device = this.lastDevice)`: the key or button to show in a prompt for action a, on the device the player used last (or the one named: 'keyboard' | 'mouse' | 'gamepad' | 'touch'), with their bindings: input.label('jump') -> 'Space', 'A' or '✕'\n297:- `input.padStyle()`: the controller family whose symbols label() shows: glyphs, or with glyphs 'auto' the one its name says\n326:- `input.glyphs = 'auto'`: the gamepad's button symbols for label(): 'auto' (from the controller's name) | 'xbox' | 'playstation' | 'nintendo' | 'generic' (positions)\n329:- `input.lastDevice = 'keyboard'`: 'keyboard' | 'mouse' | 'gamepad' | 'touch', the last one used (show the right button prompts)\n360:- `E.font.title(g, s, x, y, o = {})`: Big logo text for title screens: scaled glyphs with a vertical color gradient, an outline and an extruded 3D edge. title(g, 'CASTLE OF NIGHT', x, y, { scale: 3, colors: ['#fff6c8', '#ffd36a', '#e07a2a'], outline: '#1a0c10', depth: 3, depthColor: '#6a2a1a', a\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174822__x21985c/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5ddd0aea-0d8f-48ab-8f8a-03ad6fdbf27a","uuid":"4a7adde4-61db-497e-a927-2b26d8019dff","timestamp":"2026-11-04T00:56:03.074Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"165:- `E.ik3(a, b, L1, L2, hint)`: two-bone IK in 3D: returns [joint, end]. hint points the way the joint should bend.\n283:- `input.codeLabel(code)`: a code as a person reads it: 'W' (or